.
.  Generate sample output for Cauchy Inverse Survival plot
.
device 1 x11
device 1 font simplex
set ipl1na cauisurv.ps
device 2 postscript
.
TITLE CASE ASIS
TITLE Cauchy Inverse Survival
TITLE SIZE 3
LABEL SIZE 3
LABEL CASE ASIS
TIC LABEL SIZE 3
Y1LABEL Inverse Survival
X1LABEL X
.
PLOT CAUPPF(1-P) FOR P = 0.01 0.01 0.99
.
box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system cp CAUISURV.PS cauisurv.ps
system rm CAUISURV.PS
.
quit
